                    <item name="Size" type_name="gh_single" type_code="5">10</item>
                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">We include in this definition a Direct Text Input
parameter called "context" to switch between the
shop mode (Add to Cart button in the App) and a
backoffice mode that can be used to export files
related to each order.

After an order is placed in Shopify, the model
state corresponding to the order can be opened
from the Shopify admin dashboard, and it will
automatically set the context to order and show
the backoffice mode to enable the export
functionality.</item>
                  </items>
